      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The combination of Amazon Bedrock, carrier-specific knowledge bases, and a human-in-the-loop approval design let Worldwide Express move from assessment to production in less than 6 months while maintaining financial controls.",
